meta {
  name: Delete a contact
  type: http
  seq: 6
}
delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/acc/:acc_id/contacts/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}
params:path {
  acc_id: {{accId}}
  id: 
}
docs {
  Delete a contact

  Permanently deletes the contact. Partners and suppliers need the member's permission to manage them, and a member restricted to their own contacts can delete only those. A contact who is the sole recipient of an invoice with payments cannot be deleted (409).

  Scopes: contacts:delete
}
